  "description": "The Beyond AL is our lightweight hydro-formed aluminium Beyond. It features all our trademark Bombtrack ingredients, such as internal dynamo cable routing, a multitude of mounts on both the frame and on the aluminium fork, plus dropper post compatibility. Sram’s Apex 1 x 11 mechanical setup provides the shifting duties, while TRP callipers with 180 / 160 mm rotors control your momentum. Small bikes come with 27.5’’ wheels, M - XL bikes are fitted with 29’’ wheels and both wheelsets have tubeless-ready WTB i23 rims wrapped in all-condition Ranger 2.0’’ tyres allowing you to just get on with riding whatever the surface.\n\nWTB ST i23 double wall, TCS 2.0, 32h\n\nWTB ST i23 double wall, TCS 2.0, 32h\n\nWTB Ranger TCS Light / Fast Rolling, tubeless ready\nS 27.5'' x 2.0''\nM - XL 29'' x 2.0''\n\nWTB Ranger TCS Light / Fast Rolling, tubeless ready\nS 27.5'' x 2.0''\nM - XL 29'' x 2.0''\n\nWeight frame: 2145 g frame (size M, incl. TA, bolts, seatclamp, hanger)",
